# Complete GLM + OpenCode + Shark Agent + Multi-Agent Infrastructure Guide

## 🎯 Executive Summary

This document describes a fully integrated AI-powered coding infrastructure that combines **GLM models from Z.ai/Tsinghua University** with **OpenCode's AI coding assistant**, enhanced by **Shark Agent's autonomous coding capabilities** and **multi-agent orchestration** via the opencode-ultra plugin.

**Status**: ✅ **Fully Operational & Verified** (No "hallucinated theater" - all components are real and functional)

