## 🚀 What This Infrastructure Does

This setup enables you to:

1. **Code with GLM models** - Use real GLM models (GLM-5, GLM-4.7, GLM-4.5, etc.) through OpenCode
2. **Autonomous coding** - Shark Agent handles build-test-verify loops automatically
3. **Multi-agent collaboration** - Different AI agents work together on complex tasks
4. **Context-aware development** - Proper token management with working progress bars
5. **Dual-mode operation** - Switch between fast (GLM-4.5-flash) and deep (GLM-5) modes

**Key Benefits**:
- ✅ **Real GLM models** (not local vLLM wrappers)
- ✅ **Fixed context windows** (progress bar was stuck at 0%, now shows actual usage)
- ✅ **Autonomous coding** with build-test-verify loops
- ✅ **Multi-agent orchestration** for complex tasks
- ✅ **Verified functionality** - everything actually works

