## 📁 Configuration Files Explained

### **1. Main OpenCode Config** (`~/.config/opencode/opencode.json`)
```json
{
  "plugin": ["opencode-ultra"],  // Loads multi-agent plugin
  "provider": {
    "0-glm-coding": {
      "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",
      "name": "GLM Coding Plan",
      "options": {
        "baseURL": "https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4",  // Real GLM endpoint
        "apiKey": "{env:GLM_API_KEY}"  // Uses environment variable
      },
      "models": {
        "glm-5": {
          "name": "GLM-5 (128K)",
          "limit": {
            "context": 131072,  // 128K tokens - FIXED progress bar
            "output": 8192
          },
          "options": {
            "reasoning": { "type": "enabled", "budgetTokens": 1000 },
            "textVerbosity": "high"  // FIX: Gets content in responses
          }
        },
        // ... 6 other GLM models configured
      }
    },
    "0-local-vllm": {
      "options": { "baseURL": "http://localhost:8000/v1" },
      "models": {
        "/home/leviathan/models/Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct-AWQ": {
          "name": "Qwen 2.5 Coder 7B AWQ (Local 32K)",
          "limit": { "context": 32768, "output": 8192 }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Key Fixes Applied**:
- ✅ Added `limit.context` values (was missing, caused 0% progress bar)
- ✅ Added `textVerbosity: "high"` (GLM puts answers in `reasoning_content`)
- ✅ Real GLM endpoint configured (verified working)

### **2. Multi-Agent Plugin Config** (`~/.config/opencode/opencode-ultra.json`)
```json
{
  "agents": {
    "sisyphus": { "model": "0-glm-coding/glm-5" },      // Orchestrator
    "hephaestus": { "model": "0-glm-coding/glm-4.7" },  // Implementer
    "momus": { "model": "0-glm-coding/glm-4.7" },       // Reviewer
    "explore": { "model": "0-glm-coding/glm-4.5-flash" } // Fast search
    // ... 5 more agents
  },
  "categories": {
    "quick": { "model": "0-glm-coding/glm-4.5-flash" }, // Fast mode
    "deep": { "model": "0-glm-coding/glm-5" },          // Deep analysis
    "coding": { "model": "0-glm-coding/glm-4.7" }       // Coding tasks
  }
}
```

### **3. Shark Agent Config** (`~/.shark-agent/config.json`)
```json
{
  "mode": "macro",  // Default mode
  "micro": {
    "deepseek_api_key": "your-deepseek-api-key",
    "executor": {
      "type": "local",
      "endpoint": "http://localhost:8000/v1",
      "model": "Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct"
    }
  },
  "macro": {
    "glm_api_key": "your-glm-api-key",
    "glm_base_url": "https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4",
    "glm_model": "glm-4.5-flash",
    "deepseek_api_key": "your-deepseek-api-key"
  }
}
```

### **4. Shark Agent Skill** (`~/.config/opencode/skills/shark-agent/SKILL.md`)
Defines the autonomous coding agent with:
- Dual-mode operation (micro/macro)
- Build-test-verify loops
- Clean environment testing
- Automatic error recovery

