2. **✅ Verify OpenCode installation** (`opencode --version`)
3. **✅ Test basic query** (`opencode "Write hello world in Python"`)
4. **✅ Activate Shark Agent** (`opencode "shark agent: help me with code"`)
5. **✅ Try multi-agent** (`opencode "ultrawork: analyze this project"`)
6. **✅ Monitor context** (watch progress bar on large tasks)
7. **✅ Backup configuration** (use backup script above)

